### Health Check - Web App
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Health Check - Function App
GET http://localhost:7071/api/HealthCheck

### Authentication - Get Token
POST http://localhost:8000/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=adminpassword

### Get Schema - Web App (requires authentication)
GET http://localhost:8000/schema
Authorization: Bearer your_token_here

### Get Schema Summary - Web App (requires authentication)
GET http://localhost:8000/schema/summary
Authorization: Bearer your_token_here

### Execute SQL Query - Web App (requires authentication)
POST http://localhost:8000/query
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_token_here

{
  "query": "SELECT * FROM Users",
  "analysis_type": "summary"
}

### Execute Analytical Query - Web App (requires authentication)
POST http://localhost:8000/query
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_token_here

{
  "query": "SELECT * FROM Orders",
  "analysis_type": "trend"
}

### Get Schema - Function App
GET http://localhost:7071/api/GetDbSchema
x-functions-key: your_function_key_here

### Get Schema Description - Function App
GET http://localhost:7071/api/GetSchemaDescription
x-functions-key: your_function_key_here

### Execute SQL Query - Function App
POST http://localhost:7071/api/RunSqlQuery
Content-Type: application/json
x-functions-key: your_function_key_here

{
  "query": "SELECT * FROM Users",
  "analysis_type": "summary"
}

### Execute Analytical Query - Function App
POST http://localhost:7071/api/RunSqlQuery
Content-Type: application/json
x-functions-key: your_function_key_here

{
  "query": "SELECT * FROM Orders",
  "analysis_type": "trend"
}